{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08727","headline":"月下独酌四首 二 · 李白","name":"月下独酌四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天若不爱酒，酒星不在天。\n地若不爱酒，地应无酒泉。\n天地既爱酒，爱酒不愧天。\n已闻清比圣，复道浊如贤。\n贤圣既已饮，何必求神仙。\n三杯通大道，一斗合自然。\n但得酒中趣，勿爲醒者传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}